OL,3,GNEWSAPart of M40 southbound shut
OL,4,Afollowing incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the southbound carriageway of
OL,7,Fthe M40 has been shut due to a police
OL,8,Fincident, National Highways said.
OL,10,FThe road has been closed between
OL,11,Fjunction 1A near Gerrards Cross,
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, and junction one for
OL,13,Fthe M25 link road.
OL,15,FNational Highways said the closure was
OL,16,Fdue to a Thames Valley Police led
OL,17,Fincident, which was first reported at
OL,18,F05:45 GMT.
OL,20,FThere are delays of 45 minutes and
OL,21,Fthree miles of congestion on the
OL,22,Fapproach, the roads agency said.
